902:Eventually, we emerge before an ethereal lake.
903:Faint specks of light shimmer across its tranquil surface like a fallen sky.//nNear the shore stands an ancient stone tablet, inscribed with arcane runes.
904:Argh... This is written in witches' script.//nIt says this is the Lake of Oblivion. Only companions who share a true bond can summon the Bridge of Memories across its waters. The entrance to the sanctuary lies on the far shore.
905:Argh, we have to gaze into the lake together. If our shared memories ring true, the bridge will manifest.
906:Shall we... give it a try, {var:player_nickname}?
908:Step by step, we approach the edge and look down.
909:Our reflections ripple upon the surface as past moments spark to life like constellations –
910:From the day we met to the trust we now share,//nfrom our first team-up at Asaha High School to rescuing Piji at Datura,//nfrom the wild Halloween spectacle to this very journey into the woods... Unknowingly, we have built a long trail of memories together.
912:A translucent bridge woven from starlight slowly stretches from beneath our feet toward the lake's center.
913:Memories continue to unfold –
914:Yuzu in the Memories
918:Who's that crying her eyes out over there?
919:Th-that was definitely not me!!
