1315:Get some rest and save your strength... Tomorrow... tomorrow we'll reach the sanctuary and claim the sacred relic! Victory will be ours in no time!
1316:You can do this, Yuzu! We believe in you!
1317:...Mm! Thank you, everyone!
1318:I-it's nothing! I'm just...
1319:{var:player_nickname}! Are you okay?!
1320:H-how could this happen?!
1321:You want to light the Everlasting Mercury Lamp for your friend, don't you? Let's test your strength first and see if you're up to the mark!
1322:Argh-Argh! Argh! Argh! Arrrrgh–
1323:Arf!! Forest Guard, charge!!
1325:Arf! Don't say such stupid things!
1326:Spirits of nature, heed my call! Seal this evil away!
1327:Oh? Now this is somewhat amusing.
1328:Dark fog seals off the narrow exit in an instant! Miasma coils tightly around my limbs, bringing on a heavy, suffocating wave of exhaustion that drags my consciousness down into the abyss.
1329:Didn't your mentor teach you anything? Life magic isn't just about healing – it can take life away, too.
1330:That's monstrous! Life magic exists to protect others! I'd rather die than use magic like that!
1331:Or will you just stand there and watch the person who matters most to you wither away before your eyes... leaving you all alone again, just as you feared?
1332:In your dreams! I'll find another way! Hang in there, {var:player_nickname} –
1333:Well? Made up your mind?
1335:I will never, EVER allow vile villains to just casually steal away everyone's precious lives!
1336:But mark my words – I am the Witch of Justice! I may cry, I may be afraid, and I may stumble, but my resolve to protect others will NEVER be broken by a monster like you!
1337:Curse you... CURSE YOU!! Even so, you're bruised and battered! You won't hold out much longer! I'll corrupt that precious heart of yours – and your soul along with it!
1338:Y-you're insane! You're throwing away your mana for nothing!
1339:...Argh! We won! You all did amazing!
1340:We're bound for life now! It's way too late for regrets!
1341:D-dummy! Don't say things like that in front of everyone, argh-ghhh!!
1342:Argh-argh! We heard everything!
1343:...?//nWait, I can actually understand the red pandas now? Is this because of the contract spell?
1344:Argh! Now the captain doesn't have to hide her secrets anymore!
1345:No! I have to find a cure no matter... what...
1346:Argh-argh! That's called innovation! Progress always comes through trial and error –
1350:Over the next few days, we press deeper into the forest.
1351:Aoey
1352:I'm Aoey. Ao-Ao was my mother.
1353:Chirpy
1354:I'm Chirpy. Muk-Chirp was my great-grandmother.
1355:From what we heard earlier, it sounds like Ao-Ao, Muk-Chirp, and Chi-Gumi all lived full, happy lives.
1356:Aoey, Chirpy, Chi-Gu – this is far enough. Wait for us here while we retrieve the relic.
1357:Aoey, Chirpy, and Chi-Gu watch as Yuzu and {var:player_nickname} step into the grotto.
1358:Suspended above the altar is a globe of soft light, pulsing gently like a slow, steady breath.
1359:Aoey! What are you doing here?! Get out of here –
1360:Aoey braces herself and bears the brunt of the first dark blast.//nChirpy darts through the barrage, knocking aside the incoming spikes.//nChi-Gu throws its tiny arms wide to shield its wounded friends.
1361:The second assault strikes –//nAoey is hurled against the stone wall and slides limply to the ground.//nDark flames singe Chirpy's wing, sending her crashing down.//nChi-Gu is sent tumbling by the shockwave, but scrambles back to its feet and holds the line.
1362:Spirits of Southern Winds, when you descend, weave the bond of trust from three sacred relics – the Rootless Sauropus, the Red Lotus Flame of Sumeru, and the Everlasting Mercury Lamp – and bind {var:player_nickname} and me together.
1363:The assault dissolves. Waves of soothing radiance flow between us.//nIn my palm, the dark curse writhes before finally fading away.
1364:Sacred oath, bind our fates!!
1365:Echoes of the Witch
1366:Leia is away tracking down the faction behind the phantom, and we haven't been able to reach her.//nKaavi has hit a dead end with the life-draining curse and secluded herself to divine a solution. According to her readings, though, as long as I get plenty of rest, my life isn't in immediate danger.
1367:Aoey
1371:If I learn real magic, I can fight them head-on every time and protect everyone!
